7,0,1,talk,Mizuki,,Hello. I am Mizuki. Let's stay calm and logical. I will observe everyone closely.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Midori,,"Hi everyone. I'm Midori. I'm a bit shy, but I want to help. Let's be kind.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Takumi,,Hey. I'm Takumi. I don't trust anyone yet. Let's see who blinks first.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Jonathan,,I appreciate the introductions. Silence is often where the truth hides. Let us listen.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
