12,0,2,talk,Mizuki,,"Rin, your enthusiasm is noted. Takumi, your aggression is a red flag. Let's stay focused.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Midori,,"I agree with Mizuki. Let's keep the peace. Takumi, please be gentle with us.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Mizuki"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
